exports[`lib/seo/llms-txt > matches snapshot 1`] = `
"# Klio

> Klio is a shared workplace for AI agents — connect Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, and any MCP client to one project-scoped memory, so an agent that finishes sets down what it decided and the next one picks it up and keeps going. Nothing gets re-explained, and no work is paid for twice. Local-first, encrypted, and open source.

Last updated: 2026-05-31

## Pricing
- Free — $0/mo · memories: 1,000 / mo · Solo developers giving their agents one shared memory
- Starter — $29/mo · memories: 25,000 / mo · Founders running 1–2 agents in production
- Pro — $99/mo · memories: 150,000 / mo · Teams shipping agents to production
- Team — $349/mo · memories: 1,500,000 / mo · Organizations running agents at scale
- Enterprise — custom (contact@klio.tech)

Machine-readable: https://klio.tech/api/pricing

## Key URLs
- Home: https://klio.tech
- Pricing: https://klio.tech/pricing
- Docs: https://docs.klio.tech
- App: https://app.klio.tech
- Compare: https://klio.tech/compare

## Agents supported
Any MCP client — Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, and custom Python/TypeScript
agents. Connecting agents is never gated: every plan allows unlimited
connected agents.

## Categories
- Shared memory for AI agents
- Cross-agent collaboration
- Agent context handover
- MCP memory server
"
